# Shared concepts and regulated sums

amblim:legal-maximum a skos:Concept .

amblim:as-marketed a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "As marketed"@en .

amblim:dry-matter a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Dry matter"@en .

amblim:grain-with-husk a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Grain including inedible husk"@en .

amblim:lower-bound-sum a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Lower-bound sum"@en ;
    skos:definition "For the specified regulated sum, components below the limit of quantification are taken as zero. Missing components are not zero."@en .

amblim:fumonisins-b1-b2 a skos:Collection ;
    dct:type amblim:lower-bound-sum ;
    skos:prefLabel "Sum of fumonisin B1 and B2"@en ;
    skos:member ambpath:fumonisin-b1 ,
        ambpath:fumonisin-b2 .

amblim:t2-ht2 a skos:Collection ;
    dct:type amblim:lower-bound-sum ;
    skos:prefLabel "Sum of T-2 and HT-2 toxins"@en ;
    skos:member ambpath:ht-2-toxin ,
        ambpath:t-2-toxin .

# Source documents, archived files and provenance
# dct:date on snapshots records the date archived.
# dct:created on threshold records records the date extracted.

amblim:annex-footnote-3 a prov:Entity ;
    dct:identifier "Annex I footnote 3" ;
    dct:isPartOf amblim:current-consolidation ;
    prov:value "( 3 ) Food as defined in Article 2 of Regulation (EU) No 609/2013 of the European Parliament and of the Council of 12 June 2013 on food intended for infants and young children, food for special medical purposes, and total diet replacement for weight control and repealing Council Directive 92/52/EEC, Commission Directives 96/8/EC, 1999/21/EC, 2006/125/EC and 2006/141/EC, Directive 2009/39/EC of the European Parliament and of the Council and Commission Regulations (EC) No 41/2009 and (EC) No 953/2009 (OJ L181, 29.6.2013, p. 35)." .

amblim:annex-footnote-5 a prov:Entity ;
    dct:identifier "Annex I footnote 5" ;
    dct:isPartOf amblim:current-consolidation ;
    prov:value "( 5 ) Dry matter is determined according to Commission Regulation (EC) No 401/2006 of 23 February 2006 laying down the methods of sampling and analysis for the official control of the levels of mycotoxins in foodstuffs (OJ L 70, 9.3.2006, p. 12)." .

amblim:annex-footnote-6 a prov:Entity ;
    dct:identifier "Annex I footnote 6" ;
    dct:isPartOf amblim:current-consolidation ;
    prov:value "( 6 ) First stage processing means any physical or thermal treatment, other than drying, of or on the grain. Cleaning, including scouring, dehulling, sorting (colour sorting where applicable) and drying procedures are not considered to be ‘first-stage processing’ insofar as the whole grain remains intact after cleaning and sorting. Scouring means cleaning cereal by brushing and/or scrubbing it vigorously, combined with dust removal (e.g. aspiration). The scouring may be followed by a colour sorting before milling." .

