        amblim:general-provisions ,
        amblim:header-1-4 ;
    prov:value "1.4.1 | Unprocessed cereal grains except products listed in 1.4.2 and 1.4.3 | 1 000 | Except unprocessed maize grains intended to be processed by wet milling and except rice. The maximum level applies to unprocessed cereal grains placed on the market for first-stage processing ( 6 )." .

