# Annex I, section 1.9 — T-2 and HT-2 toxins: sum

amblim:header-1-9 a prov:Entity ;
    dct:identifier "Annex I section 1.9, header and sum definition" ;
    dct:isPartOf amblim:current-consolidation ;
    prov:value "1.9 T-2 and HT-2 toxins Maximum level (μg/kg) Remarks Sum of T-2 and HT-2 toxins For the sum of T-2 and HT-2 toxins, maximum levels refer to lower bound concentrations, which are calculated on the assumption that all the values below the limit of quantification are zero." .

