amblim:common-wheat-food-grain a skos:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "Unprocessed common-wheat grain for food at first-stage processing"@en ;
    skos:definition "Common wheat only, excluding durum wheat; unprocessed intact grain for food placed on the market for first-stage processing. Not flour, feed, infant food or a concentration on the living plant."@en ;
    skos:scopeNote "The caller must establish common-wheat identity and product stage explicitly. The broader wheat crop concept alone is insufficient. Apply the revised first-stage-processing definition in footnote 6."@en .

